    <detaileddescription>
<para>A mutex-synchronized version of <computeroutput><ref refid="classthrust_1_1mr_1_1unsynchronized__pool__resource" kindref="compound">unsynchronized_pool_resource</ref></computeroutput>. Uses <computeroutput>std::mutex</computeroutput>, and therefore requires C++11.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Upstream</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>the type of memory resources that will be used for allocating memory </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
